      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Only a month for you huh. I reported this issue back in October 2019. Still having problems with invites and friend requests including your described issue.\nIt's a miracle if anything is received in the first place and it's infuriating when it reverses an accepted friend request. In the reversing situation I find if both users send a friend request it will eventually figure out that you two want to be friends and it should stick, otherwise there is a risk of it not working when only one person sends and one person accepts. Can't be used in every situation but I found that worked for me.\nI often see people try to friend each other but then have to unfriend and keep trying until it finally shows them both as friends to each other.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
