      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Report.\nI was see notification friend requests and Invite,by IPv4 connection.\nI think so this issue is IPv4 over IPv6 connection or v6plus connection.\nI was use v6plus connection(this connection unique in japan),because IPv4 connection is very heavy traffic in Japan.\nI don't want to use IPv4 connection.I hope this issue resolve.\nThis issue is Japan user only?\nThank you.",
