      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Postscript\nThere are various types of ISP for v6 connection in Japan.\nI have heard that the IPv4 over IPv6 method has been resolved.\nI may not support IPv4 over IPv6.\nMy ISP uses MAP-E to connect, and this problem continues.\nhttps://www.jpne.co.jp/service/v6plus/\n(This web page is in Japanese)\nAlthough it is not detailed, there seems to be another method called DS-Lite.",
